# Evidence bundles are the project's primary asset. They were gitignored here until
# 2026-10-11, when a local wipe deleted 18 signed runs that existed nowhere else --
# the single worst failure mode for a project whose entire claim is that its
# evidence chain cannot be lost or forged. Evidence now travels with the code.
__pycache__/
*.py[co]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
